#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#          LINES TO BE CONSIDERED IN THE IACOB_GBAT ANALYSIS
#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# lab              : The label that will be used for the plots
# lam              : Central waveleght of the line for the plots
# fw_label         : Name of the line in FASTWIND
# chi_in   =1      : The line is considered in the chi2 computation
# step2_in =1      : The line is considered in the computation of final results
# rowx10+column_pos: Use this column to locate the various lines in the final plot

# ****************************** VERY IMPORTANT !!!! ******************************
#
# chi_in = 1, step2_in = 1 is a valid option  
# chi_in = 0, step2_in = 0 is a valid option  
# chi_in = 1, step2_in = 0 is a valid option  
# chi_in = 0, step2_in = 1 is NOT a valid option <===================
#
# *********************************************************************************
#
#----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   lab                   lam    fw_label  chi_in  step2_in  rowx10+column_pos
